<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28953511"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="380602834"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="i Love"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="azusa"/><amll:meta key="album" value="i Love"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:25.845"><div begin="00:00.968" end="04:14.226"><p begin="00:00.968" end="00:05.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I Love you from my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是真心的爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you from my heart</span></p><p begin="00:05.961" end="00:11.467" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I Love you forever with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想和你永远在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you forever with you</span></p><p begin="00:35.045" end="00:38.332" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">1日の始まりと 終わりには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天从早到晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ni chi no ha ji ma ri to o wa ri ni ha</span></p><p begin="00:38.332" end="00:44.376" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">いつも傍にあなたがいる そんな毎日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo so ba ni a na ta ga i ru</span></p><p begin="00:45.189" end="00:50.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">目を覚ませば温かいコーヒー 入れて待ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醒来之后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me wo sa ma se ba</span></p><p begin="00:50.225" end="00:54.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">あなたの左腕に抱きついた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很高兴地抱住你的左臂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no hi da ri u de ni da ki tsu i ta</span></p><p begin="00:54.946" end="01:00.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">会える日まで指折り数えていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以前我数着日子等待你的出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a e ru hi ma de yu bi o ri ka zo e te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:00.030" end="01:05.048" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">今じゃ会えない日のほうが少ないね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今几乎每天都能看到你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ja a e na i hi no ho u ga su ku na i ne</span></p><p begin="01:05.048" end="01:09.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">こんな幸せ誰が予想した!?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的幸福谁又能预想到呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na shi a wa se da re ga yo so u shi ta ?</span></p><p begin="01:09.219" end="01:14.899" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">あなたと私がそう恋をした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就这样坠入爱河了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to wa ta shi ga so u ko i wo shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:14.899" end="01:19.821" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">愛してる あなたのこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru a na ta no ko to</span></p><p begin="01:19.821" end="01:22.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">初めてのキモチよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是初次体会到的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me te no ki mo chi yo</span></p><p begin="01:24.932" end="01:30.088" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">愛してる ずっとずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru zu 't to zu 't to</span></p><p begin="01:30.088" end="01:34.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">変わらないキモチ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份感情永远不会改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra na i ki mo chi</span></p><p begin="01:35.656" end="01:38.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">無邪気なその笑顔は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你天真无邪的笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ja ki na so no e ga o ha</span></p><p begin="01:38.189" end="01:40.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">私だけが知ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi da ke ga shi 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:40.705" end="01:45.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">意外と甘えん坊なあなたのこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">意想不到你也那么爱撒娇呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ga i to a ma e n bo u na a na ta no ko to</span></p><p begin="01:45.820" end="01:48.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">子供みたいに素直ね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像个孩子那样坦率</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do mo mi ta i ni su na o ne</span></p><p begin="01:48.314" end="01:51.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">男は少しクールなくらいが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾经笑着对我说男孩子应该稍微酷一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to ko ha su ko shi ku u ru na ku ra i ga</span></p><p begin="01:51.468" end="01:55.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">カッコいいとイジメたり(笑)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样才会更加帅气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka 'k ko i i to i ji me ta ri</span></p><p begin="01:55.542" end="02:00.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">どんな時も この手を離さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时都不要放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na to ki mo ko no te wo ha na sa na i de</span></p><p begin="02:00.731" end="02:05.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">最後の恋にしようって誓ったこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们谈最后的恋爱那句誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go no ko i ni shi yo u 't te chi ka 't ta ko to</span></p><p begin="02:05.677" end="02:10.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">今はまだ内緒にしておこうか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今还需要保密吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ha ma da na i sho ni shi te o ko u ka</span></p><p begin="02:10.093" end="02:12.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">一人でニヤけている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个人在低声自问不知不觉到了凌晨零点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri de ni ya ke te ru go ze n re i ji su gi</span></p><p begin="02:12.655" end="02:15.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">午前0時過ぎ</p><p begin="02:15.557" end="02:20.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">愛してる あなたのこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru a na ta no ko to</span></p><p begin="02:20.504" end="02:23.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">初めてのキモチよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是初次体会到的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me te no ki mo chi yo</span></p><p begin="02:25.544" end="02:30.658" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">愛してる ずっとずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru zu 't to zu 't to</span></p><p begin="02:30.658" end="02:35.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">変わらないキモチ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份感情永远不会改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra na i ki mo chi</span></p><p begin="02:56.799" end="03:01.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">あなたを知って 自分を知った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">认识你也让我认识了我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wo shi 't te ji bu n wo shi 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:01.917" end="03:06.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">足りないとこは 満たし合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此弥补各自的不足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i to ko ha mi ta shi a 't te</span></p><p begin="03:06.072" end="03:11.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">二人で一つでしょ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不就两个人一条心了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri de hi to tsu de sho ?</span></p><p begin="03:13.519" end="03:18.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">愛してる あなたのこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru a na ta no ko to</span></p><p begin="03:18.650" end="03:21.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">明日も明後日も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天也是后天也是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta mo a sa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:23.712" end="03:28.685" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">愛してる きっとこれを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru ki 't to ko re wo</span></p><p begin="03:28.685" end="03:33.712" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">シアワセと呼ぶのね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一定就是所谓的幸福吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se to yo bu no ne</span></p><p begin="03:36.289" end="03:41.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">I Love you あなたのこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you a na ta no ko to</span></p><p begin="03:41.285" end="03:44.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">初めてのキモチよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是初次体会到的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me te no ki mo chi yo</span></p><p begin="03:46.422" end="03:51.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">愛してる ずっとずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te ru zu 't to zu 't to</span></p><p begin="03:51.507" end="03:56.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">変わらないキモチ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份感情永远不会改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra na i ki mo chi</span></p><p begin="04:02.189" end="04:04.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">I Love you I Love you</p><p begin="04:12.224" end="04:14.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">I Love you I Love you</p></div></body></tt>